<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>As we set our mind</l><l>On You, living One,</l><l>In our spirit, Lord, we find we are one.</l><l>What was once our case</l><l>Seem to slip away</l><l>As we fellowship with You, we long to stay.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I would linger here</l><l>In Your presence, Lord;</l><l>How we find our hearts loving You more.</l><l>As we guard our hearts,</l><l>Keep them unto Thee,</l><l>Preserve us, Lord, for all eternity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
